# ── Agentic & IDE files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `.claude/*` (not `.claude/`) so the negation below can take effect — git does
# not descend into an excluded directory, so `!.claude/agents/` would be a no-op
# against a `.claude/` rule.
.claude/*
# The ten engineering subagents are project-level and shared deliberately; the
# delegation policy that governs them lives in CLAUDE.md. Local-only files
# (settings.local.json, skills/, worktrees/) stay ignored by the rule above.
!.claude/agents/
.agents/
skills-lock.json
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp
build.log
frontend/tmp/

# ── Test artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Playwright MCP writes page snapshots / console logs here during manual QA.
.playwright-mcp/

# ── OS files ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
